# Local Roadworthy state, never content: close.sh writes the evidence ledger and the recorded
# state here, and a gate's output carries absolute paths of the machine that ran it. They are the
# same files tree-fingerprint.sh leaves out of the fingerprint for the same reason.
.roadworthy/evidence.jsonl
.roadworthy/denials.jsonl
.roadworthy/state
